<!doctype html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>ITALYERIA GREEN×EXPO 2027 Proposal</title><style>
:root{--paper:#f3eee4;--ink:#121712;--deep:#173329;--green:#71917c;--gold:#af8750;--muted:#667169;--line:#cbc2b3}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:#d9d3c8;color:var(--ink);font-family:"Yu Gothic","Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN","Noto Sans JP",sans-serif}.toolbar{position:fixed;z-index:50;top:16px;right:18px;display:flex;gap:8px}.toolbar button{border:1px solid #ffffff55;background:#173329e8;color:white;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.slide{position:relative;width:min(1440px,100%);min-height:100vh;margin:0 auto 2px;background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden;padding:82px 6vw 64px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.16fr) minmax(360px,.84fr);gap:4vw;align-items:center}.meta{position:absolute;left:6vw;right:5vw;top:28px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em}h1,h2{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.02;word-break:normal}h2{font-size:clamp(40px,4.2vw,62px);color:var(--deep)}.ja-title{margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(23px,2vw,31px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.025em;word-break:auto-phrase}.lead{font-size:clamp(17px,1.35vw,21px);line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);max-width:820px;margin:20px 0 22px;word-break:auto-phrase}.en{display:block;margin-top:.35em;color:#64706a;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.72em;font-weight:500;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:.01em;word-break:normal}.body{font-size:clamp(15px,1.08vw,17px);line-height:1.5}.body ul{list-style:none;margin:12px 0 0;padding:0}.body li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);word-break:auto-phrase}.body li .en{margin-top:.12em}.body>.en,.quote>.en,.vision>.en{margin-top:.5em}.body figure{font-size:initial}figure{margin:0;height:62vh;min-height:420px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:#ddd}figure img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.focus-right figure img{object-position:92% center}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.hero .copy{z-index:2}.hero h2{font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,86px)}.hero .ja-title{font-size:clamp(25px,2.3vw,36px)}.hero figure{height:100vh;position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:50%;border-radius:0}.quote{font-size:clamp(23px,2vw,32px);font-weight:800;color:var(--deep);line-height:1.4;margin-top:23px;word-break:auto-phrase}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:22px}.flow div{padding:20px 8px;border-top:2px solid var(--gold);font-weight:800}.flow small{display:block;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:22px}.stat{border-top:2px solid var(--gold);padding:18px 0}.stat b{display:block;font-size:30px;color:var(--deep)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px}th,td{text-align:left;padding:12px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}th{color:var(--gold);font-size:13px}.product-diagrams{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:18px}.product-card{background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:15px}.product-card b{display:block;color:var(--deep);font-size:18px}.product-card small{display:block;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}.lineup{margin-top:14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted)}.wide{grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr}.wide figure{height:68vh}.visual{grid-template-columns:1fr;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;gap:18px;padding-top:72px;align-items:start}.visual .copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:4vw;align-items:end}.visual .lead{margin:0}.visual .body{display:none}.visual figure{height:66vh;min-height:0}.full{display:block;padding:0}.full figure{height:100vh;border-radius:0}.full .copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:6vw;top:10vh;width:54%;background:#f3eee4ef;border-radius:24px;padding:40px}.full .meta{z-index:4}.caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.vision{font-size:clamp(20px,1.7vw,28px);font-weight:800;color:var(--deep);line-height:1.45;word-break:auto-phrase}.edit-on [contenteditable]{outline:2px dashed #b28b50;outline-offset:3px}.page-nav{position:fixed;z-index:40;right:16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.page-nav a{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#17332966}.page-nav a:hover{background:var(--gold)}@media(max-width:850px){.slide{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:82px 24px 38px;gap:28px}.meta{left:24px;right:24px}.hero figure{position:relative;width:100%;height:55vh}.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.visual .copy{display:block}.visual .lead{margin-top:16px}.full .copy{position:relative;left:auto;top:auto;width:auto;margin:24px}.full figure{height:55vh}.flow,.stats,.product-diagrams{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}figure{height:48vh;min-height:300px}}@media print{body{background:white}.toolbar,.page-nav{display:none}.slide{width:100%;height:100vh;min-height:0;page-break-after:always;margin:0}.slide:last-child{page-break-after:auto}}
</style></head><body><div class="toolbar"><button onclick="toggleEdit()">編集モード</button><button onclick="window.print()">PDF保存</button></div><nav class="page-nav"><a href="#p1" title="1"></a><a href="#p2" title="2"></a><a href="#p3" title="3"></a><a href="#p4" title="4"></a><a href="#p5" title="5"></a><a href="#p6" title="6"></a><a href="#p7" title="7"></a><a href="#p8" title="8"></a><a href="#p9" title="9"></a><a href="#p10" title="10"></a><a href="#p11" title="11"></a><a href="#p12" title="12"></a><a href="#p13" title="13"></a><a href="#p14" title="14"></a><a href="#p15" title="15"></a><a href="#p16" title="16"></a></nav>
<section class="slide full cover-booth" id="p1"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>01</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>RESTAURANT-QUALITY FOOD, FULLY UNMANNED.</h2><div class="ja-title">レストラン品質を届ける完全無人の販売空間。</div><p class="lead">商品を売るだけではなく、選ぶ・温める・知る・楽しむまでを一つの体験にします。<span class="en">More than vending: one seamless experience from discovery and purchase to heating and enjoyment.</span></p><div class="body"><div class="vision">料理人の品質を、人・席・営業時間の制約から解放する。<span class="en">Free chef-driven quality from the limits of staffing, seating and opening hours.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide visual" id="p2"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>02</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>FIVE ZONES CREATE ONE CONTINUOUS EXPERIENCE.</h2><div class="ja-title">五つのゾーンを、一つの体験としてつなぐ。</div><p class="lead">DISCOVER → BUY → HEAT → WAIT & LEARN → TAKE AWAY。入口から出口までを、ブースそのものが案内します。<span class="en">DISCOVER → BUY → HEAT → WAIT & LEARN → TAKE AWAY. The booth itself guides the entire journey.</span></p><div class="body"></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide visual" id="p3"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>03</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>THREE GUESTS. THREE ACTIONS. NO SINGLE QUEUE.</h2><div class="ja-title">三人が、別々の行動を同時に進められる。</div><p class="lead">Aは購入、Bは加熱、Cは映像を見ながら待機。一人の待ち時間が、次のお客様を止めません。<span class="en">A buys, B heats and C learns while waiting. One guest’s waiting time never stops the next guest.</span></p><div class="body"></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p4"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>04</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>ENJOY IT ANYTIME WHILE EXPLORING THE EXPO</h2><div class="ja-title">時間を選ばず、会場を楽しみながら食べられる。</div><p class="lead">朝食だけではなく、昼食・間食・夕方の軽い食事まで。万博の回遊行動に合わせた商品提案です。<span class="en">From breakfast and lunch to snacks and light evening meals—a lineup designed around how visitors move through the Expo.</span></p><div class="body"><div class="product-diagrams"><div class="product-card"><b>ITALIAN DELI BOX</b><small>自然解凍で食べられる洋食軽食を、一箱にまとめた「イタリアン弁当」。</small><small>A ready-to-eat Italian deli selection that can be enjoyed after natural thawing.</small></div><div class="product-card"><b>FOLDED PIZZA</b><small>電子レンジで温め、片手で持って会場を回遊できる。</small><small>Microwave, hold in one hand, and enjoy while exploring.</small></div></div><div class="lineup"><b>展開商品：</b> イタリアン軽食ボックス／折りピザ／四角ピザ／ジェラート／ブリオッシュ等<span class="en"><b>LINEUP:</b> Italian deli box / folded pizza / tray pizza / gelato / brioche and more</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide wide" id="p5"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>05</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>WE HAVE ALREADY SERVED VISITORS AT THE EXPO</h2><div class="ja-title">万博で、実際に販売しました。</div><p class="lead">2025年4月〜10月、大阪・関西万博ソマリア館でCASA CUOMO CAFEを運営。<span class="en">We operated CASA CUOMO CAFE at the Somalia Pavilion throughout Expo 2025 Osaka.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>世界各国の来場者へ料理とジェラートを販売<span class="en">Served food and gelato to visitors from around the world</span></li><li>混雑・猛暑・需要変動を現場で経験<span class="en">Managed crowding, extreme heat and volatile demand</span></li><li>冷凍販売とセルフ加熱で供給を補完<span class="en">Used frozen products and self-heating to expand supply</span></li><li>会計列と調理待ちの軽減に貢献<span class="en">Helped reduce checkout and preparation queues</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide wide" id="p6"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>06</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>PROVEN IN JAPAN—AND EXPORTED OVERSEAS</h2><div class="ja-title">国内各地で販売し、海外にも輸出しています。</div><p class="lead">THE BLOSSOM HIBIYAの24時間ラウンジをはじめ、ホテル・流通・観光拠点へ供給。冷凍ピザは香港への輸出実績もあります。<span class="en">From a 24-hour guest lounge at THE BLOSSOM HIBIYA to hotels, retail and tourism sites across Japan—plus frozen-pizza exports to Hong Kong.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>JR Blossom Hotel 日比谷<span class="en">THE BLOSSOM HIBIYA, Tokyo</span></li><li>Fairfield by Marriott 福岡<span class="en">Fairfield by Marriott, Fukuoka</span></li><li>ウェスティンホテル大阪／Green Beans<span class="en">The Westin Osaka / Green Beans</span></li><li>香港向け冷凍ピザ輸出<span class="en">Frozen-pizza exports to Hong Kong</span></li></ul><div class="quote">国内で売り、海外へ運ぶところまで実証済みです。<span class="en">Proven not only in domestic sales, but in international delivery.</span></div><p class="caption">THE BLOSSOM HIBIYA / Casa Cuomo Pizzeria</p></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p7"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>07</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>TAKING CHEF-DRIVEN QUALITY BEYOND THE RESTAURANT</h2><div class="ja-title">料理人の品質を、レストランの外へ届ける。</div><p class="lead">サルバトーレ・クオモは、九州にある自身の研究所で長い時間をかけ、入念に商品開発を続けています。<span class="en">At his own research laboratory in Kyushu, Salvatore Cuomo has spent years carefully developing food that can carry a chef’s quality beyond the restaurant.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>日本にナポリピッツァを広め、国内外でレストランを展開してきた料理人<span class="en">A chef who helped establish Neapolitan pizza in Japan and built restaurants in Japan and overseas</span></li><li>そこで知ったのは、美味しさが料理人・厨房・席・営業時間の中に閉じ込められていること<span class="en">He learned that great food is often confined by chefs, kitchens, seating and opening hours</span></li><li>だから、小麦・水・発酵・焼成・急速冷凍・再加熱までを一つの料理として設計<span class="en">So he designs flour, water, fermentation, baking, blast freezing and reheating as one complete culinary process</span></li><li>目指すのは、料理人がいない場所でも、料理人がつくった味を届けること<span class="en">The goal: deliver chef-made taste even where no chef is present</span></li></ul><div class="quote">美味しさを、まだ届いていない場所へ。<span class="en">Bringing great taste to places it has not yet reached.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p8"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>08</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>FROZEN INVENTORY ABSORBS EXTREME DEMAND SWINGS</h2><div class="ja-title">冷凍だから、大きな需要変動に対応できる。</div><p class="lead">来場者が多い日は在庫からすぐ提供し、少ない日は商品を次の販売機会へつなげます。<span class="en">Frozen inventory meets sudden peaks and carries unsold stock safely into the next sales opportunity.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>急増時：仕込みを待たずに供給<span class="en">Peak demand: serve directly from inventory</span></li><li>減少時：長い販売期限を活用<span class="en">Slow periods: use extended shelf life</span></li><li>追加の調理人員なしでピーク対応<span class="en">Handle peaks without adding kitchen staff</span></li><li>販売データを次の製造へ反映<span class="en">Use sales data to guide production</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p9"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>09</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>UNMANNED SALES, SYSTEM-GUARDED QUALITY</h2><div class="ja-title">販売は無人でも、品質は仕組みで守れる。</div><p class="lead">人をなくすのではなく、人にしかできない仕事へ集中させます。<span class="en">Automation lets people focus on the work that truly requires human skill.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>料理人：商品開発と品質づくり<span class="en">CHEFS: product development and quality</span></li><li>システム：説明・会計・販売データ<span class="en">SYSTEM: guidance, payment and sales data</span></li><li>機器：温度管理・異常通知・安全停止<span class="en">EQUIPMENT: temperature control, alerts and safe stop</span></li><li>運営：補充・清掃・保守を定期化<span class="en">OPERATIONS: scheduled restocking, cleaning and maintenance</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64,